      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُرَاكَةٌ</span></b>  <i>What is drawn from the udder before
the first</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِيقَة</span> [or <i>milk that collects in the udder
between two milkings</i>], (K,) <i>and before the second</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فيقة</span> <i>collects:</i> also termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلَاكَةٌ</span> [perhaps a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُلَالَةٌ</span>] and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُلَاكَةٌ</span>. (TA.)

